Title: Zombie
Artist: The Cranberries
Key: E minor (Aeolian)
Tempo: 83
Time: 4/4

# Em C G D, one bar each, for the entire song — intro, verse, chorus and solo
# are the same four bars. 26 passes over the recording's 106 bars.
#
# The D is a whole bar and not a half: the recording changes on the downbeat of
# bar 4 of every cycle (bench/inspect_song.py, bars 4–7 and 8–11), so a chart
# reading `| G D |` has the change two beats early.
#
# Note: harmonically uniform. The section split is the arrangement, not
# something the chords could tell you.

